  "caveats": {
    "expansion": "Screening signal from traffic and operations data only. It does not prove the terminal is the bottleneck or that a project is profitable (no capex, lease, concession or gate data).",
    "congestion": "Delays have many causes (weather, ATC, airline operations, airspace). Airport infrastructure is only one of them.",
    "demand_pressure": "Unmet demand is not directly observable in public data. This is a proxy built from load factor, passenger-vs-seat growth and congestion.",
